{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月24日，據《金融時報》報道，當地時間周一，隨着黃仁勳意外被恢復英偉達CEO職務的消息傳出，英偉達股價飆升。<strong>美國總統特朗普持有的英偉達股票價值最高上漲1500萬美元(約合1億元人民幣)。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587778.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:23:52.382124+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:59:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T03:17:13.071699+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T03:17:13.071699+00:00","content_hash":"b8fe3f62727f5d0cd1009a89f611190fdd31765f6429ce6b748e388bd0cf2cbb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}